OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering daytime showers will soon
OL,7,Ffade to leave a largely dry night,
OL,8,Fwith lengthy clear spells for many.
OL,9,FMay turn locally chilly in some
OL,10,Fsheltered rural spots. Windy,
OL,11,Fespecially on hills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAfter a cool start it will be
OL,14,Fa fine day with variable amounts of
OL,15,Fcloud and sunny spells for many. Windy
OL,16,Fat first, gradually easing. Cloud and
OL,17,Frain arriving overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
